Z||000005||GarethWright||10-20-2001||03:38 AM||||Yea that Broken Arrow school thing is certainly true, some whiny people around here complained about the seperation of church and state (no sarcasm intended) but hey, this IS the bible belt, all the other marquee signs around here have God Bless America plastered all over em!<BR>Heck, I drove by my 8th grade PUBLIC school tonight and theres a chuch running services in there after hours!<P>Lol Jake_Dragon, in our neighborhood we have a rule against those GIANT Satelite dishes, the guy who moved in next door to us about a year ago stuck one on the back of his house, saying "It's Mine, they can't make me take it down!" Now HE is the Home-owners assoc. President!||||reg||1
